  "content": "<div id=\"readability-page-1\" class=\"page\"><div> <p> <h2>18 thoughts on “Nintendo has raised its employees base salary by 10%”</h2> </p> <ol> <li id=\"comment-item-3079946\"> <article id=\"comment-3079946\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/dd16f469be301a306ef21056a286d37113f571692ca1fd16c0e2e3fb192c2701?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/dd16f469be301a306ef21056a286d37113f571692ca1fd16c0e2e3fb192c2701?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>Employee raises and building new buildings. Take notes Xbox and Playstation!</p> </div> </article> </li> <li role=\"listitem\"><ol> <li id=\"comment-item-3079958\"> <article id=\"comment-3079958\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5265e5d6d70c0266ca071ec30ce483386f55399507f1a8eba921042af8b0efe8?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5265e5d6d70c0266ca071ec30ce483386f55399507f1a8eba921042af8b0efe8?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>They did, but they raised console prices instead 😂</p> </div> </article> </li> <li role=\"listitem\"><ol> <li id=\"comment-item-3080018\"> <article id=\"comment-3080018\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f3da34ad2c0c57eefe6b810a298b7e2538694b7d82685c9b7a0725f3cdbb6619?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f3da34ad2c0c57eefe6b810a298b7e2538694b7d82685c9b7a0725f3cdbb6619?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>Nintendo is only raising prices slowly because Switch 2 is already a bit overpriced to begin with, fooling yourself If you actually think Nintendo would take a loss on hardware or software for that matter.</p> </div> </article> </li> <li role=\"listitem\"><ol> <li id=\"comment-item-3080052\"> <article id=\"comment-3080052\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/dd16f469be301a306ef21056a286d37113f571692ca1fd16c0e2e3fb192c2701?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/dd16f469be301a306ef21056a286d37113f571692ca1fd16c0e2e3fb192c2701?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>It’s not a bit overpriced. Specs really close to Series S, with a screen, a dock, grip, and 2 controllers.</p> </div> </article> </li> </ol></li><!-- close children li --> <li id=\"comment-item-3080091\"> <article id=\"comment-3080091\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e2965d735cfb28110dc6c75e9eb2838a8ed1d2c13908420d8b542a8a04fa7128?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/e2965d735cfb28110dc6c75e9eb2838a8ed1d2c13908420d8b542a8a04fa7128?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>By the lowest amount of all the companies that have announced price increases and yet after that:<br>\n– salary increase<br>\n– new 121 billion yen R&amp;D</p> </div> </article> </li> </ol></li><!-- close children li --></ol></li><!-- close children li --> <li id=\"comment-item-3079948\"> <article id=\"comment-3079948\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/353807208bbd9cba73e5d2a711e18ca5dafd82d2a1d731ef3a38a9a8f1ca0017?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/353807208bbd9cba73e5d2a711e18ca5dafd82d2a1d731ef3a38a9a8f1ca0017?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p> </article> </li> <li id=\"comment-item-3079949\"> <article id=\"comment-3079949\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/610b46746077bcb9a7f456c6b9da4fe90cbdff717cdcf176cf11f1dd877b8f01?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/610b46746077bcb9a7f456c6b9da4fe90cbdff717cdcf176cf11f1dd877b8f01?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>In today’s world. That is actually incredible.</p> </div> </article> </li> <li id=\"comment-item-3079951\"> <article id=\"comment-3079951\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/40b6151afd4357ce39521cfb7278b1bb988ed0dcc5e9b327ce29200f1fabbd73?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/40b6151afd4357ce39521cfb7278b1bb988ed0dcc5e9b327ce29200f1fabbd73?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p> </article> </li> <li role=\"listitem\"><ol> <li id=\"comment-item-3079976\"> <article id=\"comment-3079976\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/dc9b7d41d2b154b4d0da2fc60f3987775bd4ec8e2185976fbd6bfa05986691c3?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/dc9b7d41d2b154b4d0da2fc60f3987775bd4ec8e2185976fbd6bfa05986691c3?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>The OriginalGaner in Red is a fake</p> </div> </article> </li> <li role=\"listitem\"><ol> <li id=\"comment-item-3079978\"> <article id=\"comment-3079978\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/62cbf237b615ed646ed3af1f53b9cda69918f2f319b95ff2fed39de9b27565ff?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/62cbf237b615ed646ed3af1f53b9cda69918f2f319b95ff2fed39de9b27565ff?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>I know you are the real roll because of your icon. Ok, I will try to make a list of people who have these icons who the real person.<br>\nRoll=pink+Dark Blue<br>\nOriginal gamer=Cyan+DarkBlue<br>\nCFG=Yellow+Brown<br>\nTruthbringer=Pink+DarkPurple<br>\nDid I get that correctly?</p> </div> </article> </li> <li role=\"listitem\"><ol> <li id=\"comment-item-3079990\"> <article id=\"comment-3079990\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/08de15584f712f5ad69fab3d79bff9f83995089db1e896b17f82496aad559359?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/08de15584f712f5ad69fab3d79bff9f83995089db1e896b17f82496aad559359?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>I think OriginalGamer is BrightBlue+Green</p> </div> </article> </li> <li id=\"comment-item-3079991\"> <article id=\"comment-3079991\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/40b6151afd4357ce39521cfb7278b1bb988ed0dcc5e9b327ce29200f1fabbd73?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/40b6151afd4357ce39521cfb7278b1bb988ed0dcc5e9b327ce29200f1fabbd73?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>No, you didn’t. You’re literally encouraging the trolls to continue all this identity theft BS.</p>\n<p>What is wrong with you?</p> </div> </article> </li> <li role=\"listitem\"><ol> <li id=\"comment-item-3080148\"> <article id=\"comment-3080148\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5265e5d6d70c0266ca071ec30ce483386f55399507f1a8eba921042af8b0efe8?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/5265e5d6d70c0266ca071ec30ce483386f55399507f1a8eba921042af8b0efe8?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>He’s not, these Avis show up different to everyone. To me you show up purple with a pink background.</p> </div> </article> </li> </ol></li><!-- close children li --></ol></li><!-- close children li --></ol></li><!-- close children li --></ol></li><!-- close children li --> <li id=\"comment-item-3079963\"> <article id=\"comment-3079963\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/91dac583058e68e7d5b040f265fc51bac252e6241a68939bb451dce8a4eef445?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/91dac583058e68e7d5b040f265fc51bac252e6241a68939bb451dce8a4eef445?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>Nintendo needs to buy Square Enix and then Sega</p> </div> </article> </li> <li role=\"listitem\"><ol> <li id=\"comment-item-3079968\"> <article id=\"comment-3079968\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/42bbb0585644f9127a2e45bfcb2c55c2f25bd5699eb69e6694cc372b8a123ce7?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/42bbb0585644f9127a2e45bfcb2c55c2f25bd5699eb69e6694cc372b8a123ce7?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>But buy Capcom before Sega of course. Seriously, how many crossovers between Mario and Sonic without Mega Man are enough for you people?</p> </div> </article> </li> </ol></li><!-- close children li --> <li id=\"comment-item-3079970\"> <article id=\"comment-3079970\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0c62f6a2a2da958177fe3f10388df5900a753220cede830f9b95e3da2c4a163b?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/0c62f6a2a2da958177fe3f10388df5900a753220cede830f9b95e3da2c4a163b?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>This is a misinterpretation.</p>\n<p>Furukawa is stating they have done things in the past to maintain employee retention to include raising base salaries by 10% back in 2023.</p>\n<p>Nintendo is not raising wages by 10% in 2026.</p> </div> </article> </li> <li id=\"comment-item-3079972\"> <article id=\"comment-3079972\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/62cbf237b615ed646ed3af1f53b9cda69918f2f319b95ff2fed39de9b27565ff?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/62cbf237b615ed646ed3af1f53b9cda69918f2f319b95ff2fed39de9b27565ff?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>I feel like nintendo does that exact opposite of what the rest of the video game industry does. When every company does massive lay offs, they raise their salaries. When companies are focusing on AI rather then making games, nintendo doesn’t use AI and they pump out more games faster. It really is impressive how well nintendo does thing.<br>\nI am fine if nintendo raises it’s prices for everything if they increase the salary for the workers.</p> </div> </article> </li> <li id=\"comment-item-3079981\"> <article id=\"comment-3079981\"> <p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7eb9975567290c4259087cbf2dbe7d9af786f95f8f4076d09ef45ac16b4da970?s=50&amp;d=retro\" srcset=\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/7eb9975567290c4259087cbf2dbe7d9af786f95f8f4076d09ef45ac16b4da970?s=100&amp;d=retro 2x\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><div> <p>And meanwhile, Microsoft is shutting down and laying off, Sony is squandering Bungie….</p> </div> </article> </li> </ol> </div></div>",
